Cazej
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 88 ROTATE 3 U 3
ICU 1 FACE_LAST
ICU 6 FACE_LAST
ICU 9 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK ICU ICU
OR
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank add_13
        DEST Empty
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        DESTSRC Suit match
$win
AND
    PILE ALL ICU Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL ICU Empty
        PILE ALL ICU Empty
